{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13002","headline":"登山谷寺上方答皇甫侍御卧疾阙陪车骑之後 · 独孤及","name":"登山谷寺上方答皇甫侍御卧疾阙陪车骑之後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵宫香阁攀霞上，天柱孤峯指掌看。\n汉主马踪成蔓草，法王身相示空棺。\n云扶踊塔青霄庳，松荫禅庭白日寒。\n不见戴逵心莫展，赖将新赠比琅玕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}